    "description_html": "<p><strong>Introducing Electra Soft Touch Ballpoint Pens!</strong></p>\n<p>Experience the perfect blend of style and comfort with our popular aluminum click-top metal ballpen. Featuring a tactile soft-touch coating, this pen is available in a wide range of matte colors with a sleek chrome metal clip and trim.</p>\n<p>It's one of the <a href=\"../../../../pens/metal-pens/\">custom metal pens</a> in the Custom Genie range.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Wide Range of Colors</strong>: Choose from 8 different matte colors to match your style.</li>\n<li><strong>Tactile Soft-Touch Coating</strong>: Enjoy a comfortable grip with the soft-touch coating that feels great in your hand.</li>\n<li><strong>Digital Print Area</strong>: Showcase your logo or design with a generous digital print area of 50 x 6.5mm, printed in full color beside the clip.</li>\n<li><strong>Smooth Writing</strong>: Equipped with black ink for a classic and professional look.</li>\n<li><strong>Click-Top Action</strong>: Convenient click-top mechanism for effortless use.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Why Choose Our Electra Soft Touch Ballpoint Pens?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Full-Color, High-Resolution Digital Printing</strong>: Your logo or design will be printed in vibrant, high-resolution color.</li>\n<li><strong>No Setup Fees</strong>: Start your order without any additional setup costs.</li>\n<li><strong>No Design Fees</strong>: Enjoy the freedom to create without worrying about design charges.</li>\n<li><strong>Free Delivery</strong>: Get your pens delivered to your doorstep at no extra cost.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Order Your Electra Soft Touch Ballpoint Pen Today!</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Elevate your writing experience with a pen that combines elegance, comfort, and functionality. Customize your pen with your logo and text, and make a lasting impression. Click the \"Buy Now\" button and add this stylish pen to your collection!</p>"
